From b33fbd24ace566d8db20c8e2d7a295680084ac7b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:04:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(vfs): retain explicit inode timestamps and archive mtime

Keep access and modification times with owned inode identity, expose them
through stat/statx, and support explicit utimensat/futimens updates.
Persist representable whole-second modification times in bounded archives
and verify matching hardlink metadata during startup restore.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
---
